  message: "Done in PR #3475 (joint with WI-pilam-jukus). Default search scope broadened from packages/ → packages/, scripts/, .agent/ via the new DEFAULT_SEARCH_ROOTS constant in hypergumbo_core.axis_drift. Each axis can override per-call. The broader scope surfaced one phantom-value bug fixed in the same PR: scripts/bakeoff-deep _FFI_EDGE_TYPES contained jni_bridge and pyffi_bridge (neither emitted; JNI emits native_bridge); same shape as ADR-0023 §1 cases 4-5."  # 06e9
